<script>
    use big_ui_test.postpaint;
    use j3.game.env;
    use j3.text.same;
    let custom: bool = !same(env("UI_POST_SHADER"), "0");
    let tilt: bool = !same(env("UI_POST_TILT"), "0");
</script>

<div class="pipeline">
    <div class="intro">One cached render texture feeds two views. The right view projects the texture in perspective and runs a custom GLSL color pass.</div>
    <div class="controls">
        <button class:chosen={custom} on:click={custom = !custom}>Custom shader {if custom { "on" } else { "off" }}</button>
        <button class:chosen={tilt} on:click={tilt = !tilt}>Perspective {if tilt { "on" } else { "off" }}</button>
    </div>
    <div class="labels"><div>Cached 320 x 200 render texture</div><div>Projected texture + optional shader</div></div>
    <canvas on:draw={postpaint.draw(size, custom, tilt)}></canvas>
    <div class="recipe">target / beginTarget / endTarget / targetTexture / projectTexture / beginLayer / endLayer</div>
    <section>
        <h2>Retained UI in perspective</h2>
        <div class="stage">
            <div class="card" class:tilted={tilt}>
                <div class="eyebrow">A WHOLE UI GROUP</div>
                <h2>Depth, with readable text.</h2>
                <div>Perspective projects the group's background, children and border together.</div>
                <div class="bars"><div></div><div></div><div></div></div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="recipe">{if tilt { "perspective: 700px; rotate-x: 8deg; rotate-y: -18deg" } else { "perspective: none; rotate-x: 0; rotate-y: 0" }}</div>
    </section>
    <div class="note">Custom shader source defines vec4 effect(vec2 uv, vec4 color), with uTex, uResolution and uTime uniforms. Resources are cached and released at context shutdown. Perspective is a projected UI plane; hit testing still uses the unprojected box.</div>
</div>

<style>
    .pipeline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
    .intro { font-size: 14px; }
    .controls { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    button { font-size: 13px; }
    button.chosen { background: var(--accent); color: #11111b; }
    .labels { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
    canvas { width: 100%; height: 260px; }
    .recipe { font-size: 12px; color: #89dceb; }
    section { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; padding: 16px; background: var(--panel); border-radius: 14px; }
    h2 { font-size: 18px; }
    .stage { display: flex; justify-content: center; padding: 16px 20px; background: #111827; }
    .card { width: 80%; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; color: #ffffff; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #245978, #25494e); border: 2px solid #62c8c6; border-radius: 16px; }
    .card.tilted { perspective: 700px; rotate-x: 8deg; rotate-y: -18deg; }
    .eyebrow { font-size: 11px; color: #c3f6ff; }
    .bars { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .bars div { width: 50px; height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: #ffc568; }
    .note { font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--muted); }
</style>
